<title>USA: Lehman Brothers to issue $150 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers to issue $150 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Holdings Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $150 million 12-year debt issue on their own behalf, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Price talk on the Baa1/A-rated issue is seen 95 basis points over the 10-year U.S. Treasury note, dealers said.</p>
<p>Lehman Brothers Holding is a major investment banking firm.</p>
<p>(( -- Nancy Leinfuss, U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1675 ))</p>
